say/krzysztof_sharp	I'll say this once, kindly, because I do like you. Don't push it.
say/krzysztof_warm1	Good to see you. No angle, honest, just glad you're about.
say/krzysztof_warm2	Come here, you. How's things? And don't say fine, nobody's fine.
say/marcin_sharp	Don't test me today, blyat, I'm held together with tape and cheap wine.
say/marcin_warm1	Kurwa, it's you. Good. Sit. Don't leave me and all, everyone bloody leaves.
say/marcin_warm2	You get it. You actually get it. Not like her. Suka. Not like her.
say/sebastian_sharp	Don't bring the mood down, I'm three good decisions from sorted.
say/sebastian_warm1	My friend! Perfect timing, I'm basically turning it all around today.
say/sebastian_warm2	You and me, we're the smart ones. Going places. Any day now, kurwa.
say/tom_sharp	I'm stranded, not so stranded I'll take that. Careful, there's a good chap.
say/tom_warm1	Ah, a friendly face. I'd offer you tea but I've a degree and a pigeon.
say/tom_warm2	Good to see you. Marginally better company than my life choices.
